-- no where
line 3: a block's first line names it and ends in where
-- metadata that is none of the three
line 4: x as whatever is not ‹x› as occurrence, ‹x› as binder or { ‹x›, … } as binders
-- a production with no arrow
line 4: a production is ‹name› -> ‹items›, or ‹name› : ‹metadata› -> ‹items›
-- a bracket never closed
line 4: a [ is never closed
-- a line indented less
line 5: this line is indented less than the productions above it
